WEBVTT

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.220
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.950
Go! You look good in that uniform!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.840
Yeah? Well, I look good
in everything, you know!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.160
Let’s get going already.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.420
I’ll be off, then.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.720
I’m off.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.720
See you later!

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.560
So there you were.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.320
A Fire Stone.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.970
Still no evolution today, I see.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:09.050
We still don’t know that for sure.
What’s up next?

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.150
A Thunder Stone.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.410
Why won’t you evolve?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.620
How come you haven’t
caught any Pokémon, Koharu?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.100
I have Wanpachi.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.810
Wanpachi belongs to
the Director, yeah?

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.650
I’m talking about catching
your <i>own</i> Pokémon.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.360
Maybe I won’t.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.610
You won’t?! Why?

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:26.820
People make it out like I <i>have</i> to catch Pokémon
just because I’m a professor's daughter.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.190
It doesn’t feel right.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.970
I had that happen to me in a class about
our future aspirations a while back.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.530
Ah...

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.060
Uh, sorry, then.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.400
Don’t worry about it!

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:44.430
My mom told me that a day will come
when I’ll get to decide my own path.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.800
<i>I’m</i> sorry for making you apologize.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.600
Go! Koharu!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.100
Good morning.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.350
Good morning!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.890
I kept my promise perfectly, yeah?

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.040
Promise?

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.670
To make sure to be at school
when there’s a test!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.520
And promises should be kept!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.650
I’ll see you in the classroom, then.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.750
You promised her that?

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:06.570
Well, yeah.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:12.290
Oh, right. Don’t forget to
leave that Pokémon in the garden.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.550
Messon!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.980
Go, Aceburn!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.710
Take care of Messon
until I come back, yeah?

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.080
Look...
It’s a mountain of treasure!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.100
There’s so many Pokémon
at this school!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.640
We’ll take them all
for Team Rocket, meow.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.820
It’s settled.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.750
There! There she is!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.720
Hey! Hold it!

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:30.630
Don’t run away!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.680
Wait, special Eevee!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.890
Wanpachi!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:42.000
Why does Wanpachi
run off on his walks...?

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.020
There?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.820
Wanpachi... and an Eevee?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.790
Hold on!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:48.900
Eevee!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.530
Who’re those guys?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.990
Yeah. Let’s follow them!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:57.990
Sneakity-sneak...

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.330
I am an actress.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.500
There is no role I cannot perform!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:08.790
Yeah! I can even play a cute
and spry pwetty widdle schoolgirl!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:12.210
That’s an actress’s fate!
That is my fate!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.140
Spry, huh...?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.250
<i>Nobody</i> uses that word
anymore, meow...

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.460
There she is!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.830
Is this right...?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.370
It’ll have to do.
Next question...!

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.990
Oh! I studied this with Renji!

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.710
All right! Thanks, Renji!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:16.630
Miss!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.840
What is it? Koharu?

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:24.590
Ah, uh, um, dad’s, uh, pachi...

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.080
Oh! Well, hurry back!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.170
Wanpachi!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.800
What’s wrong?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.630
Where’s that Eevee...?!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.420
Once we find her,
she’s not getting away again!

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:32.210
Pocket Monsters!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.040
We... completely lost
track of Wanpachi...

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.170
Isn’t this Koharu and Go’s...?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.490
What is it, Koharu?
Why’d you call me out here?

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.980
Shh!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.130
Wanpachi?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:08.460
An Eevee?!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.190
That’s why I went, shh! Shh!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.520
Sorry. But why do you
have an Eevee, Koharu?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:16.540
Uhh...

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:21.070
Eevee’s an amazing Pokémon,
with eight confirmed evolutions!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.820
Eight?! That <i>is</i> amazing.

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:27.530
So, why are you hiding?

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:29.530
It looks like she’s being chased...

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.600
Huh?

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.830
By them!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.460
Where are you? Eevee!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.580
Come on out!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.840
Yeah...
They <i>do</i> look suspicious.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.080
See?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.570
Don’t worry. I’ll look after you.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.670
Eevee!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:54.980
Where are you?!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.030
Got it. I’ll do something
about them.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:11:59.840
Huh?

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.170
Koharu, you run
when you get the chance!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.240
Go?

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.750
What’s wrong?!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.670
Old lady, are you visitors here?!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.990
Old lady?!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.760
No, it’s more, umm...

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.680
Should I call a teacher?!

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:13.830
Oh, no...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.000
You don’t need to do that...

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.630
Don’t tell me that
you’re <i>trespassers?!</i>

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.290
Let’s go, Wanpachi.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.780
There she is! Eevee!

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.560
Run for it, Koharu!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.020
Thank you!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.360
Whatta wot of suction powah!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.460
Hey! Don’t get in our way!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:45.240
That’s why we have hyper mode!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.070
What a big catch!

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.740
Success, meow!

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:58.750
What are you doing?!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:02.100
I saw that!
The Pokémon were fighting back!

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:04.130
The bwat boy?!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.760
And Pikachu...!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.760
Owww...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.370
We thought that might happen,

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:19.080
so we dug a pit,

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.540
and good thing we did, meow!

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.780
Hold it!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.780
What now?

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:25.530
Brat boy Mk. II?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.590
And a brat girl?!

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:28.870
What’s this?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.120
You’re not getting away!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.120
Hand over Eevee!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.380
We will not!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:39.900
Yeah! We’re not letting bad guys like you
take this Eevee!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:40.920
Go?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.960
Oh, no, we’re not bad guys...

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.430
It’s a misunderstanding!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:49.300
We’re researchers from the
Eevee Evolution Laboratory.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.910
The Eevee Evolution...
Laboratory?

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.310
Hey! Go! Koharu!
Are you there?!

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.560
Satoshi?

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:02.760
Those guys up there sucked Pokémon up
into a machine!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.510
The Pokémon are gone...!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:11.080
Messon! Aceburn!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.710
Give the Pokémon back!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.220
If you say “Give the Pokémon back!”...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.300
We’ll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:36.290
To protect the world from devastation.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.140
To preserve world peace.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.400
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.940
We’re the lovely, charming villains.

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:46.690
Musashi!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.820
Kojiro!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.280
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.660
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.080
Just kidding, meow!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:03.920
So they were Team Rocket...!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.800
Vending, come on!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.560
Ready, set...

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.020
Rocket...

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.340
Vending...

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.360
I wonder, what’ll I be getting?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.190
Secret!

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.360
Huh? Why’s nothing coming?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.680
Is it not working?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.370
Stop it, Kojiro!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.720
No luck?

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:41.300
Hey! Pelipper!
No Monster Balls came out!

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:44.080
You’d better take responsibility for this!
You hear that?!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.380
Still, it’s not going to come back...

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.590
It came back!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.990
So you <i>will</i> take
responsibility? Great!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.950
Okay! Kojiro, you command it!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:55.930
Huh?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.160
Wanpachi...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.470
All right.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.620
Good job! Go for it, Wanpachi!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.270
Pelipper! Wing Attack!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.490
Wanpachi! Spark!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.090
Wanpachi!

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.040
Eevee?

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:36.200
Eevee...

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.040
You want to battle?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.420
What are you doing, Kojiro?!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:44.060
Hurry up with the next move,
have, have it do something!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.040
Pelipper, use Hydro Pump!

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:48.690
Hydro Pump is a
super strong move, meow!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.450
Wanpachi! Eevee! Spark!

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:13.280
Did you... see that?

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.680
Y-Yeah...

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.800
You did great,
Eevee! Wanpachi!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.500
Now’s our chance...

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:23.520
Let’s get out of here...

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.320
Quick, meow!

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:27.290
Pikachu! Iron Tail!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.280
Aceburn! Messon!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.030
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.270
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:56.770
You did it, Pikachu!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.180
We’ve caused you
so much trouble.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.740
We’re very sorry
for everything.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:11.750
Oh, don’t worry, it seems these two
misunderstood what was going on.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.170
Sorry...

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.320
Oh, it’s nothing.
We’ll be off then.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.070
Eevee?!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.160
This Eevee
really loves Koharu, huh?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.870
It appears so.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:16.130
She’s a pretty mysterious Eevee.
She won’t evolve whatever we try.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:19.940
She won’t evolve into
any of the eight Pokémon?

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:21.050
Right.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:29.490
Eevee have unstable genes in general,
so maybe that one’s genes are more unstable than most.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:34.760
Or perhaps... Maybe she’s hesitant,
unable to decide what path she should take.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.530
Hesitant...

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:39.790
Though that’s not a
very scientific perspective.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.200
Hey, Koharu...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.740
If you wouldn’t mind,
do you think you could look after Eevee?

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.840
Huh?

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:48.980
You want to stay
with Koharu, don’t you?

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:53.300
Eevee...

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.710
If you say it’s okay...!

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.460
Thank you.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:02.430
So your first catch
is an Eevee, huh?

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.230
Here!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:08.720
She’s telling you she’s ready!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.940
Eevee...
I want to stay with you, too!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.420
That’s your first catch!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:31.540
A great success!

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.500
Come on out, Eevee!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.930
They’ve already made friends!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.350
That’s great to see.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.860
Koharu. I put a Rotom in here.

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:59.610
A Smartphone Rotom
for Koharu?

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.540
Go on, try it out!

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:02.320
Right!

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:04.060
Eevee!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:09.580
Eevee. Evolution Pokémon. Normal type.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:16.710
It has a very unstable genetic makeup.
This Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:20.330
Many different possibilities
for evolution...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.760
Maybe she’s hesitant,
unable to decide what path she should take.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.390
Let’s take things one step at a time.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.720
Together.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:38.020
Koharu caught Eevee,
and finally became a Pokémon Trainer.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:42.570
Many possibilities stretch out
before them.

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.770
Mew!

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:52.520
Warrgle!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.310
Runpappa!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.080
Pawou!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.820
Ulgamoth!

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.610
Strike!

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:56.410
Cresselia!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.120
Amakaji!

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:57.930
Jirachi!

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:58.730
Chobomaki!

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.500
Kibago!

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.270
Gonbe!

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.050
Bayleaf!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02.550
Freezer!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.740
Zacian!

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:20.590
Mew!

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:21.420
Wooper!

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.140
Pachirisu!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:22.990
Sunaba!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:23.650
Absol!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.510
Lunala!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.320
Rabbifoot!

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.100
Tropius!

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:26.870
Sunahebi!

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:27.740
Vibrava!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:28.390
Burshamo!

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:29.160
Mokuroh!

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:29.980
Rotom!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:30.700
Mooland!

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:31.480
Dodorio!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:32.200
Otosupus!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.020
Swanna!

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:33.770
Nazonokusa!

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:34.590
Samehada!

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:35.360
Darkrai!

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.040
Iwanko!

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:36.870
Cortoise!

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:37.700
Scorupi!

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:38.480
Pippi!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.200
Pinpuku!

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:39.980
Kunugidama!

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:40.720
Mankey!

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:41.530
Kimori!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:42.350
Ligray!

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:43.780
Rayquaza!

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:44.510
Zamazenta!

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.590
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:10.910
Go!

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:13.010
I’m Gasattsu.

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:15.560
I’m here on a dig
to excavate fossils.

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:17.170
Are you here
looking for fossils too?

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:17.830
Yeah!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.410
You’re late, Ukattsu!

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:22.270
But I forgot to set my alarm...

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:23.500
You’re so careless...

00:23:23.930 --> 00:23:26.970
